 "id": "bundle_s2_ndvi_monthly_ait_bouguemez",
 "title": "Catchment NDVI, Sentinel-2 monthly",
 "description": "Monthly NDVI over the Ait Bouguemez valley catchment (geo_ait_bouguemez_catchment revision 1) from Sentinel-2 L2A (Earth Search legacy sentinel-2-l2a), 2019-01 to 2025-12, at 10 m in EPSG:32629: per-pixel median of clear dates, area median and spatial IQR over pixels with at least 3 clear dates. A period is available when such pixels cover at least 70% of the catchment.\n\nReduced QA (scene classification only): snow and terrain shadow can survive the mask. The spatial IQR is variability across pixels, not a confidence interval. Item geometries are the catchment simplified to one DEM pixel; the exact frozen geometry is the analysis_geometry asset. The input set is exactly the derived_from items of each period: one item per tile and sensing date, the newest processing baseline, skipping a duplicate with no valid pixels over the catchment. Display rasters and value grids are not part of this version.",
 "license": "other",
